 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving an opinion",
     "texto": [
      "To give your opinion: **selon moi** (in my view), **à mon avis** (in my opinion), **personnellement** (personally).",
      "To agree or disagree: **Je suis d'accord** (I agree), **Je ne suis pas d'accord** (I don't agree)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Arguing",
     "texto": [
      "To organize your ideas: **d'un côté... de l'autre** (on the one hand... on the other), **en effet** (indeed), **bref** (in short).",
      "Example: **En effet, tu as raison en partie** (indeed, you are right in part)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
